function trapFocus(container){releaseFocus();if(!container)return;var focusable=container.querySelectorAll('button:not([disabled]),input:not([disabled]),select:not([disabled]),textarea:not([disabled]),[tabindex]:not([tabindex="-1"])');if(!focusable.length)return;var first=focusable[0],last=focusable[focusable.length-1];state._focusTrap=function(e){if(e.key!=='Tab')return;if(e.shiftKey){if(document.activeElement===first){e.preventDefault();last.focus()}}else{if(document.activeElement===last){e.preventDefault();first.focus()}}};document.addEventListener('keydown',state._focusTrap);var main=document.querySelector('main');if(main)main.setAttribute('inert','')}
